Modifications:
This fork includes numerous improvements and fixes over the original DrawDB:
- Enhanced TypeScript type safety (removed many 'any' types)
- Fixed database schema handling with proper Dexie types
- Improved component type definitions
- Additional bug fixes and performance improvements
- Table color customization features
- Enhanced editor configuration options

